[544.679153, "o", "ther child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-303|CL wording paraphrase|OI-299|Neither child should stay overnight with her unless the father is there.\r\nST-318|unless mother present|OI-208|Neither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-319|father alone overnight ok|CL-302|Either child may remain overnight in her care even if the father is away.\r\nST-415|meeting request not overnight condition|OI-208|I am writing to request a meeting with counsel.\r\nST-518|CL match|OI-208|Neither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-519|unless mother|CL-302|Neither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-543|wording delivery|OI-208|Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\nST-589|neither child overnight unless father present|CL-309|Neither child ought to stay overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\n"]
