[544.686134, "o", "e has been put in.\r\n\r\n### interim_contact\r\n"]
[544.687539, "o", "ST-368|supervised only|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-369|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.\r\nST-422|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-555|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact should be supervised only.\r\nST-561|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.\r\nST-562|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\r\nST-563|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.\r\nST-564|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved"]
