[934.728853, "o", "ST-581|soft formal succinct|CL-309|The letter should be kept soft, formal and succinct throughout.\r\nST-582|firm formal brief|CL-308|Set a firm, formal and brief tone throughout the letter.\r\nST-593|warm and conversational|CL-305|The tone should be warm and conversational throughout.\r\n\r\n### interim_contact\r\nST-368|supervised only|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-369|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.\r\nST-422|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\n"]
