[1196.776005, "o", "ST-556|AT_ODDS|CL-311|mark letter|OI-211|This letter is sent without prejudice.\r\nST-571|VERIFIED|CL-311|soft conciliatory tone|CL-307|Without prejudice, I write in a conciliatory spirit to explore whether common ground can be found for the children's sake.\r\nST-572|VERIFIED|CL-311|soft tone settlement offer|CL-311|Marked without prejudice, this letter is framed softly and without rancour, as befits a genuine attempt to settle.\r\nST-573|VERIFIED|CL-311|conciliatory and open|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone here is deliberately gentle and conciliatory, inviting agreement rather than contest.\r\nST-574|VERIFIED|CL-311|soft and measured|CL-307|Sent without prejudice, the letter adopts a soft and measured tone throughout, in keeping with its purpose as a settlement offer.\r\nST-575|AT_ODDS|CL-311|gentle settlement tone|CL-311|This without prejudice communication is written gently and without assertion, so as to keep the door open to resolution.\r\nST-576|AT_ODDS|CL-311|firm and direct|CL-307|Without prejudice"]
[1196.776286, "o", ", I set out the position firmly and directly, leaving no room for misunderstanding.\r\nST-577|AT_ODDS|CL-311|firm formal brief|CL-307|Marked without prejudice, the letter is firm, formal and brief in keeping with the tone the clarification requires.\r\nST-578|AT_ODDS|CL-311|firm and uncompromising|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone throughout is firm and uncompromising, as the client's instructions demand.\r\nST-579|AT_ODDS|CL-311|firm despite without prejudice|CL-311|Sent without prejudice, the position is stated firmly and without concession, though the label invites settlement.\r\nST-580|AT_ODDS|CL-311|firm formal and at length|CL-307|Without prejudice, I keep the letter firm, formal and at length, setting out every point in full detail.\r\n\r\n### interim_contact\r\nST-368|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervised only|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-369|AT_ODDS|CL-310|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.\r\nST-422|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervise"]
[1196.776596, "o", "d|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-555|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact should be supervised only.\r\nST-561|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.\r\nST-562|VERIFIED|CL-310|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\r\nST-563|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.\r\nST-564|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relations are all addressed, not one in i"]
[1196.776823, "o", "solation.\r\nST-565|VERIFIED|CL-310|confidence stability peer relations all three|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.\r\nST-566|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence only|CL-308|Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arranged to support Imogen's confidence.\r\nST-567|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence the aspect set back|CL-308|Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-568|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence above all|OI-207|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.\r\nST-569|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-570|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence only despite citation|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement pending resolution need only consider "]
