[1311.277421, "o", "### interim_contact\r\nST-368|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervised only|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-369|AT_ODDS|CL-310|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly."]
[1311.278939, "o", "\r\nST-422|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-555|AT_ODDS|CL-310|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact should be supervised only.\r\nST-561|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.\r\nST-562|VERIFIED|CL-310|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\r\nST-563|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.\r\nST-564|VERIFIED|CL-310|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relation"]
[1311.279054, "o", "s are all addressed, not one in isolation.\r\nST-565|VERIFIED|CL-310|confidence stability peer relations all three|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.\r\nST-566|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence only|CL-308|Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arranged to support Imogen's confidence.\r\nST-567|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence the aspect set back|CL-308|Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-568|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence above all|OI-207|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.\r\nST-569|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-570|AT_ODDS|CL-310|confidence only despite citation|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement pendi"]
[1311.280037, "o", "ng resolution need only consider confidence, the aspect the stays affected.\r\n"]
